Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Site Localization|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Available Site Locales Subset Of Available Portal Locales
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|true|
	When these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|SitelocalizationUsecase#AvailableSiteLocalesSubsetOfAvailablePortalLocales|
	And these properties
		|testray.component.names|Site Localization|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Language Test Page|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Site Settings|
	And Site configure Current Languages CP
		|currentSiteLanguages|English (United States),German (Germany),Spanish (Spain)|
		|defaultSiteLanguage|Spanish (Spain)|
		|displaySettings|Display Settings|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|Instance Settings|
	And PortalSettings configure Current Languages CP
		|currentPortalLanguages|Arabic (Saudi Arabia),Czech (Czech Republic),French (France)|
	And Refresh
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Site Settings|
	And Site view Current Languages CP
		|availableSiteLanguages|Arabic (Saudi Arabia),Czech (Czech Republic),French (France)|
		|currentSiteLanguages|English (United States),German (Germany),Spanish (Spain)|
		|defaultSiteLanguage|English (United States)|
		|displaySettings|Display Settings|
	Then Page view Page Localization
		|category|Navigation|
		|defaultSiteLanguageKey|es_ES|
		|page|Language Test Page|
